# Maintained text-play smoke script for seed 24318.
#
# This file is the shared script an automated probe and a human reviewer both run:
#
#   cargo run --locked --bin text-play -- --seed 24318 --script tests/text_play/opening_smoke.script
#
# It only issues ordinary player commands; the adapter fails with the offending line number if the
# command surface or the opening world regresses. Keep it short and free of pre-coded opinions about
# what a player "should" want, so it stays a boundary check rather than a scripted policy.

look
status
inventory
# Walk east to the visible berry bush, braking after the crossing as the real client requires.
e 20
wait 10
look
# Gather a bounded handful and finish the work interval.
gather 1 250
wait work
inventory
status
